(6612881, 987265, 96751, '<td valign="top">This looks like it won''t end well.  The angle makes it appear he''s headed for the cement pier, and his body position like he''s unconscious.  I like the intent, and there is something satisfyingly disturbing about this scene.  I don''t think the ball adds anything to the image.  Plus desating everything but the ball gives it much more prominence than you may have intended, and pulls the eye from the "leap"</td>', 'This looks like it won''t end well.  The angle makes it appear he''s headed for the cement pier, and his body position like he''s unconscious.  I like the intent, and there is something satisfyingly disturbing about this scene.  I don''t think the ball adds anything to the image.  Plus desating everything but the ball gives it much more prominence than you may have intended, and pulls the eye from the "leap"', '2011-12-07 12:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
