(6612901, 986895, 49018, '<td valign="top">Agreed, conquering freedom of speech can be a pretty painful move :D<br/>As a fellow bearded man, I feel your pain.<br/>I am very incompetent at studio lighting, but it looks like it was pretty tough to balance things so to protect detail everywhere. Great job with the jacket and silver tape, but the skin seem to have suffered a bit in the process (unless the harshness/posterization was intentional. The rim light on the hair works well but it also look like it was abruptely cut at the bottom.<br/>You have some pretty good drammatic light setups in your portfolio, I wonder how this pose would have worked with one of them.<br/>But I like it, good job!</td>', 'Agreed, conquering freedom of speech can be a pretty painful move :DAs a fellow bearded man, I feel your pain.I am very incompetent at studio lighting, but it looks like it was pretty tough to balance things so to protect detail everywhere. Great job with the jacket and silver tape, but the skin seem to have suffered a bit in the process (unless the harshness/posterization was intentional. The rim light on the hair works well but it also look like it was abruptely cut at the bottom.You have some pretty good drammatic light setups in your portfolio, I wonder how this pose would have worked with one of them.But I like it, good job!', '2011-12-07 12:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
