(6613225, 987265, 49018, '<td valign="top">Wonderul capture and perfectly framed.<br/>The ball makes for an essential visual counterpoint to the diver, who''s presumably about to curl and close into a ball as well. A future symmetry which gives dynamism and it''s also mirrored in the two identical ladders.<br/>Or perhaps I am just crazy :)<br/>But I love it, wonderful capture.</td>', 'Wonderul capture and perfectly framed.The ball makes for an essential visual counterpoint to the diver, who''s presumably about to curl and close into a ball as well. A future symmetry which gives dynamism and it''s also mirrored in the two identical ladders.Or perhaps I am just crazy :)But I love it, wonderful capture.', '2011-12-07 19:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
