(6613239, 987282, 2700, '<td valign="top">an image like this should "pop".. the yellow and white stripes should provide a large contrast between the black asphalt. In this photo everything seems very subdued. Also, I think the image would be better conveyed if the curves weren''t cropped out of the road.. More detail in the rider would also help.</td>', 'an image like this should "pop".. the yellow and white stripes should provide a large contrast between the black asphalt. In this photo everything seems very subdued. Also, I think the image would be better conveyed if the curves weren''t cropped out of the road.. More detail in the rider would also help.', '2011-12-07 19:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
