(6618129, 987300, 137576, '<td valign="top">thanks guys :) <br/> <br/>im trying to not fit in with the pack all warm friendly freedom esq hehe i liked the simplicity and teh starkness that actually for a man that is condemned to die the only freedom is death itself<br/> <br/>my heavy metal one is going to be non mainstream as well hehe :) <br/> <br/><a href="//www.flickr.com/photos/cyberprop/6510715581/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//farm8.staticflickr.com/7162/6510715581_a13d743cf0.jpg'', strrpos(''//farm8.staticflickr.com/7162/6510715581_a13d743cf0.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//farm8.staticflickr.com/7162/6510715581_a13d743cf0.jpg"/></a> <br/><a href="//www.flickr.com/photos/cyberprop/6510715581/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Untitled</a> by <a href="//www.flickr.com/people/cyberprop/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">gilesbert</a>, on Flickr</td>', 'thanks guys :)  im trying to not fit in with the pack all warm friendly freedom esq hehe i liked the simplicity and teh starkness that actually for a man that is condemned to die the only freedom is death itself my heavy metal one is going to be non mainstream as well hehe :)   Untitled by gilesbert, on Flickr', '2011-12-14 09:27:22.000000', NULL, 0),
