(6618395, 987335, 90947, '<td valign="top">I find this shot very interesting.  When I first looked at it, I initially thought the shadows around the brushes were wrinkles in the fabric covering the surface, as if the surface were soft.  The curve of the surface on the back, which was earlier attributed to short lens length, contributed to my perception error.  <br/> <br/>Being a frustrated artist, I like the idea.</td>', 'I find this shot very interesting.  When I first looked at it, I initially thought the shadows around the brushes were wrinkles in the fabric covering the surface, as if the surface were soft.  The curve of the surface on the back, which was earlier attributed to short lens length, contributed to my perception error.   Being a frustrated artist, I like the idea.', '2011-12-14 15:55:29.000000', NULL, 0),
